## Lemma Target
Audited finite form:
  every survivor gate in the 135-row bank belongs to an exact two-gate
  mirror orbit; no fixed or unpaired gate occurs.
  dead_components(row)>0 still implies a low-rank E/branch mirror orbit.
  cover-delta debt >=7 is confined to 8 mirror orbits on 7 random rows.
This upgrades HYP-3471 from colored gate words to colored gate orbits.
The next proof obligation is a finite hard-orbit discharge: route those
8 same/cross-branch two-sided orbits through HYP-3455/HYP-3451, or name
owner-current, two-adic, endpoint-spine, phase-branch, or signed-SPEC debt.

